{"parse": {"title": "11TH-17", "pageid": 110488, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/11TH-16\" title=\"11TH-16\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">11TH-17</span><a href=\"/wiki/11TH-18\" title=\"11TH-18\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">11TH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">17</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.B2.89.E9.BB.98.E7.9A.84.E9.A3.8E.E8.BD.AE\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"沉默的风轮\">沉默的风轮</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 沉默的风轮</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Serenity on the Wind</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>如<span class=\"color-value\"></span>果<span class=\"color-value\"></span>没<span class=\"color-value\"></span>有<span class=\"color-value\"></span>这<span class=\"color-value\"></span>场<span class=\"color-value\"></span>战<span class=\"color-value\"></span>争<span class=\"color-value\"></span>…<span class=\"color-value\"></span>…<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 11117</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_fengcheyuanye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_fengcheyuanye\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_fengcheyuanye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/af/Cg-3_0_bg_fengcheyuanye.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_fengcheyuanye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/af/Cg-3_0_bg_fengcheyuanye.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_fengcheyuanye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/af/Cg-3_0_bg_fengcheyuanye.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_fengcheyuanye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">战马：</div><div>咴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>出来，到我这儿来，好孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>也许是马儿天然更亲近一名骑士，它耷拉着脑袋，向玛尔纱蹭了过去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">战马：</div><div>咴……咴咴——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>哈哈——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>天呐，玛丽，这真是一匹马。看看它的毛色！上校都不会有这么漂亮的伙伴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>它很亲近你嘛……你会骑马吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>看看你在问什么，玛丽安娜，我可是一名骑士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>即使没有马鞍，训练有素的骑士仍然飞快地攀上了马背。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-526510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-526510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-526510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>抓住我的手，上来——我带你骑一段！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>犹豫片刻后，她握住了骑士向她递来的手。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_at_qixing.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_at_qixing\"><img alt=\"3_0_at_qixing\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Cg-3_0_at_qixing.png/600px-Cg-3_0_at_qixing.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Cg-3_0_at_qixing.png/900px-Cg-3_0_at_qixing.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Cg-3_0_at_qixing.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_at_qixing.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>这片原野太适合骑马狂奔了，可是我担心你会颠下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>那你自己骑就好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>不，那有什么意思呢？——但你还是得抓紧我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>驾——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>嘿！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>哈哈哈哈——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>玛丽，我没想到你不会骑马。但我可以教你如何与马匹相处——只需要把它们想象成特大号的猎犬。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>等你回家之后，我会来找你，如何？——那个时候你会在哪里？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>巴黎？——也许不会。我也搞不明白。但我会试着开一家服装店。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>那你要取一个我一眼就能认出来的店名……不，你一定会成为特别出名的设计师，都不需要我刻意去找。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>你能给我做一套游行礼服吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>我不明白这该怎么做，但我想……我可以学。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>天呐，我会拥有一套法国设计师量身定做的游行礼服，简直就像是在做梦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>哈哈……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_fengcheyuanye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_fengcheyuanye\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_fengcheyuanye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/af/Cg-3_0_bg_fengcheyuanye.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_fengcheyuanye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/af/Cg-3_0_bg_fengcheyuanye.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_fengcheyuanye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/af/Cg-3_0_bg_fengcheyuanye.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_fengcheyuanye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>自从战争降临以来，从未有过如此安然的时光可供消磨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她们都骑累了，就放走了驯顺的马儿，任它在草地中寻觅嫩叶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>可是，我要如何知道你的下落呢？之后基金会应该还会把你派到其他地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>没错，我们和重塑之手之间的冲突还没有结束。但我总能想办法联系到你的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>我不想评价你的选择，但……尽量活下去，玛尔纱，不要太勇敢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>为什么要说这么奇怪的话，玛丽？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>假如这一切都有结束的时候，到那一天，我希望……还能再见到你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>我也是。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>……我会为你祈祷，虽然我不太确定我的声音是否能被听见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>我不像她——艾格尼丝。她是从天堂来到人间的天使，至于我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>石像鬼将眼神掩藏在阴影中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜：</div><div>算了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“哔哔——”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"528101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"528101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/HeadIconSmall-528101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-528101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">战马：</div><div>咴咴——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>诶——？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>通讯器的噪音惊扰了安静的马匹，它倏然抬头，奔向远处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>啊……它逃走了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她拿起通讯器，再次看见了未署名的呼叫人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/HeadIconSmall-526420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/HeadIconSmall-526420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/HeadIconSmall-526420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>玛尔纱，尽快到前线待命，具体坐标我已经发送给你了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/HeadIconSmall-526420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/HeadIconSmall-526420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/HeadIconSmall-526420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>如果石像鬼愿意跟你走，最好把她也一起带上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526515.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-526515.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526515.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526515.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-526515.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526515.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/HeadIconSmall-526515.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526515.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>你到底是谁？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"526420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/HeadIconSmall-526420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-526420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"526420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/HeadIconSmall-526420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-526420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0d/HeadIconSmall-526420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-526420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>——我们很快就会见面。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "11TH-17"}}